{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026UCrOm0jeXA1792849724.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞殘運乒乓及羽毛球代表凱旋。</p><p></p><p>乒乓代表率先步出機場，包括在女子WD22級雙打，摘銀的王婷莛及吳玫薈。女子WD14級，女雙銀牌的焦瑾珊、王愉程。還有在羽毛球男子SH6級單打拿銅牌的朱文佳等。</p><p></p><p>港隊今屆共派出80名運動員出戰名古屋亞殘運，共奪3金、14銀、24銅。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T14:40:16.704313+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T13:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T20:58:06.397164+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T14:36:52.962434+00:00","content_hash":"b3074954f53704b6ce68ca74f43c5c3b6ea83ca4fa71c952b06f005684657b74","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}